  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "The setting of the game is shaped like a puzzle and the level designs are built to realize a fast and agile run. It is a short story to show why the character is “afraid” and an “afraid” emotion is shown on his pixel face. You need to collect all the eggs in a level, carefully considering how you will move, placing the different blocks in certain ways so you may collect all the eggs and finish the stage."
    }
